flowchart LR
    U[User / Browser] --> FE[React + Vite UI]
    FE --> API[FastAPI REST API]
    API --> DB[(SQLite locally / PostgreSQL in Compose)]
    API --> RET[Embedding and retrieval layer]
    RET --> DOCS[Ranked document context]
    DOCS --> LLM{Groq key configured?}
    LLM -->|Yes| GROQ[Groq chat completion]
    LLM -->|No or failed| FALLBACK[Extractive answer fallback]
    GROQ --> OUT[Answer + source metadata]
    FALLBACK --> OUT
    OUT --> HIST[(Persistent chat history)]
    OUT --> FE
